*
* Output samples of GOST bytes 0140..0177 via extracode 071.
* Each sample is one 48-bit word, issued by a separate terminal-output
* extracode call.  The program first requests the attached-terminal scale
* with IS = -1, then puts the lowest logical terminal number into the
* output and status control words.
*
 СЧ ВСЕТЕР
 Э71 ВСЕТЕР          SET "NEW" TERMINAL MODE, A := ATTACHED TERMINALS
 НЕД 0               A := LOWEST LOGICAL TERMINAL NUMBER
